{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And Deborah died.</b> Rashi asked: what business did Deborah have in Jacob's household — that is, how is Deborah found with Jacob? For it is written, 'כי במקלי עברתי' (for with my staff I crossed). Rather, this teaches that Rebecca sent Deborah after Jacob to bring him back, as it says: 'ושבת עמו ימים אחדים עד אשר תשוב חמת אחיך' (you shall stay with him a few days until your brother's anger turns), 'ושלחתי ולקחתיך משם' (and I will send and take you from there). He did not want to come, and Deborah remained with Jacob in Laban's house and died on the road with Jacob. Since above she was left unnamed when it says 'וישלחו את רבקה אחותם ואת מינקתה' (they sent Rebecca their sister and her nurse), now it mentions her name."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:24.473093401Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}